title: "PHP Form Spam Checker"
version: 2.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/paulmann/PHP-Form-Spam-Checker"
url: "https://github.com/paulmann/PHP-Form-Spam-Checker"
abstract: >-
  Framework-agnostic spam filtering for PHP 8.5 forms: an ordered pipeline of
  local, behavioural and network checks, an optional HTTP firewall with nine
  rules, CLI and HTTP bridges, and structured evidence for every verdict.
  Zero runtime Composer dependencies.
